    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Cantrip.</strong> You learn the Guidance cantrip. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat).</p><p><strong>Helpful Premonition.</strong> When you or a creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself fails a saving throw, you can take a Reaction to roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the save’s total, potentially turning the failure into a success. You can use this benefit a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-REeLG2FytmRNAa4P\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Helpful Premonition</em> rolls the bonus to add to the failed save.</p></section>",
